maintainer-fresh	fleet	route the independent review
maintainer-stale	fleet	update the branch; base is stale
maintainer-unknown	fleet	base freshness unknown; refresh the base comparison
maintainer-review-required	maintainer	review required
maintainer-cannot-merge	maintainer	delivery awaits the maintainer
maintainer-away	fleet	checks green; merge is authorized by delivery posture
nobody-fresh	fleet	route the independent review
nobody-stale	fleet	update the branch; base is stale
nobody-unknown	fleet	base freshness unknown; refresh the base comparison
nobody-review-required	maintainer	review required
nobody-cannot-merge	maintainer	delivery awaits the maintainer
nobody-away	fleet	checks green; merge is authorized by delivery posture
ok - maintainer and nobody verdicts do not override fresh, stale, unknown, review-required, cannot-merge or away rows
